---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Credit Risk Institute – KIPROD"
  description="The KIPROD Credit Risk Institute provides thought leadership and insights on credit risk management, supporting executives and boards with decision-useful publications and engagement."
  activePath="/institute"
>
  <section class="hero" style="min-height: 56vh">
    <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 80px">
      <h1 class="hero-heading">Credit Risk <em>Institute</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        The Institute provides thought leadership and insights on credit risk management within financial
        institutions—supporting leadership teams in understanding evolving risk dynamics and making informed decisions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag reveal">Overview</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Decision-useful insight for <em>executives and boards</em>.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        The Institute focuses on emerging trends, portfolio insights, and sector developments—delivered as practical
        articles, executive briefs, and downloadable reports.
      </p>

      <div class="about-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr">
        <div class="mini-panel reveal" style="background: var(--cream)">
          <div class="mini-title">Focus areas</div>
          <ul class="bullets" style="margin-top: 14px">
            <li><span class="dot"></span>Emerging credit risk trends</li>
            <li><span class="dot"></span>Portfolio risk insights</li>
            <li><span class="dot"></span>Sector developments</li>
            <li><span class="dot"></span>Executive-level discussions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mini-panel reveal" style="background: var(--cream)">
          <div class="mini-title">Purpose</div>
          <div class="mini-note">
            To support leadership teams in understanding evolving risk dynamics and making informed decisions—without
            academic heaviness. The tone is corporate, practical, and usable.
            <br /><br />
            Phase 2 will expand a full publications hub (articles, briefs, and downloadable reports).
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height: 20px"></div>
      <div class="section-tag reveal">Insight series (placeholders)</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Executive briefs &amp; publications.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        The client requested a branded Insight Series for authority. Below are Phase 1 placeholders until the final
        templates are delivered.
      </p>

      <div class="download-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)">
        <div class="download-card reveal">
          <div class="pill">Insight brief</div>
          <div class="download-title">Why Loans Go Bad Despite Strong Credit Policies</div>
          <div class="download-desc">A short, decision-useful brief for executives and boards (placeholder layout).</div>
          <a class="arm-link" href="/contact">Request a briefing →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="download-card reveal">
          <div class="pill">Market insight</div>
          <div class="download-title">Early Warning Failures in Financial Institutions</div>
          <div class="download-desc">Practical insight on early warning signals and monitoring discipline (placeholder layout).</div>
          <a class="arm-link" href="/contact">Request a briefing →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="download-card reveal">
          <div class="pill">Downloads</div>
          <div class="download-title">Publications &amp; sales tools</div>
          <div class="download-desc">Download placeholder assets (brochure, one-pager, welcome pack, case study template).</div>
          <a
            class="arm-link"
            href="/downloads/Credit_Risk_Governance_Review_One_Pager_PLACEHOLDER.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            Open downloads →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="about"
    style="
      padding-top: 70px;
      padding-bottom: 70px;
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(196, 136, 42, 0.2);
    "
  >
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag reveal">Next</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Make it practical—<em>book a discussion</em>.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        If you want to explore governance review, diagnostics, or training for your institution, the next step is a
        short confidential discussion.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 18px" class="reveal">
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/contact" style="text-decoration: none">Next: Contact →</a>
        <span style="display:inline-block; width: 10px"></span>
        <a href="/academy" class="arm-link">Or: Start with the Academy →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

